actical connection to Jura in the area, and on the northeastern shores of Lake Biel (Bielersee, Lac de Bienne), sharing the eastern tip of the lake with its sister city, Nidau. The city has more than 50,000 inhabitants and the agglomeration more than 100,000.","grounding":[{"source":"wikivoyage","title":"Biel","url":"https://en.wikivoyage.org/wiki/Biel","licence":"CC BY-SA 4.0"}],"short":"Biel/Bienne is the 10th largest city of Switzerland and is located on the northern edge of the canton of Bern. Nidau, Orvin and Pasquart Kunsthaus lead its 12 sights. A full day covers it, ideally in June to September.","short_src":"composed","facts":{"population":55120,"visit_h":9.4}},"highlights":[{"id":"hl-nidau","name":"Nidau","kind":"Landmark","lat":47.12503,"lon":7.24116,"dist_km":1.4,"sig":2.509,"rank_score":5.8,"resolved_by":"retyped","fact":"Municipality in Bern, Switzerland","image":{"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/02/Stedtlifest_Nidau_01.jpg/960px-Stedtlifest_Nidau_01.jpg","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Stedtlifest_Nidau_01.jpg","ok_print":false},"wikipedia":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nidau","heritage":true,"merged_from":["Schlossmuseum Nidau"]},{"id":"hl-orvin","name":"Orvin","kind":"Landmark","lat":47.16069,"lon":7.2127,"dist_km":3.6,"sig":2.483,"rank_score":5.8,"resolved_by":"retyped","fact":"Municipality in Bern, Switzerland","image":{"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c8/Orvin_Suisse.JPG/960px-Orvin_Suisse.JPG","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Orvin_Suisse.JPG","ok_print":false},"wikipedia":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Orvin","heritage":true},{"id":"hl-pasquart-kunsthaus","name":"Pasquart Kunsthaus","kind":"Museum","lat":47.13885,"lon":7.24008,"dist_km":0.5,"sig":1.118,"rank_score":5.1,"resolved_by":"catalogue"},{"id":"hl-epsach","name":"Epsach","kind":"Landmark","lat":47.06903,"lon":7.2198,"dist_km":7.8,"sig":2.483,"rank_score":4.3,"resolved_by":"retyped","fact":"Municipa